sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant G as Gateway (Envoy + CRS)
  participant E as Engine (models)
  participant R as Redis
  participant A as Upstream app

  C->>G: HTTP request
  G->>G: TLS · normalize · CRS score · rate / IP checks
  G->>E: ext_authz check (method, path, headers, body)
  E->>E: features → M1..M4 → ensemble + denylist check
  alt allow / log
    E-->>G: 200 (allow)
    G->>A: forward request
    A-->>C: response (leak-masked if configured)
  else challenge
    E-->>G: 429 + JS / proof-of-work page
    G-->>C: challenge interstitial
  else block
    E-->>G: 403
    G-->>C: blocked
  end
  E--)R: emit decision event (async, off the request path)
